      "english_text": "Where is he?",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "english_text": "I put him on a leaf high on a tree.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "english_text": "He took Mrs. Dewdrop to the tree.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "english_text": "But of course, Drippy was gone.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "english_text": "I saw Drippy, the Queen Bee said.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "english_text": "That's wonderful.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "english_text": "Where is he?",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "english_text": "I put him on a beautiful flower.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "english_text": "I'll take you to him.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "english_text": "They hurried to the flower, but Drippy was not there.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "english_text": "I saw Drippy, the hummingbird told Mrs. Dewdrop.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "english_text": "Oh, thank you.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "english_text": "Where is he now?",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "english_text": "I saw the wind take him away.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "english_text": "Mrs. Dewdrop hurried to find the wind.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "english_text": "Where is he?",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "english_text": "I put him down in a field of corn.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "english_text": "So Mrs. Dewdrop hurried to the field of corn, and she saw the two beautiful butterflies.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "english_text": "Has anyone seen Drippy?",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "english_text": "Mrs. Dewdrop asked.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "english_text": "We were playing with him, but he fell down and went into the ocean.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "english_text": "That's the last we saw of him.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "english_text": "And Mrs. Dewdrop was heartbroken.",
      "japanese_text": null
    },
    {
